       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. FUNCTIONSTATS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 SCORES-TABLE.
          05 SCORE PIC 9(3) OCCURS 5 TIMES.
       01 TOTAL PIC 9(4).
       01 RANGE-VAL PIC 9(3).
       01 MEAN-VAL PIC ZZ9.99.
       01 VARIANCE-VAL PIC ZZZ9.99.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE 70 TO SCORE(1)
           MOVE 80 TO SCORE(2)
           MOVE 90 TO SCORE(3)
           MOVE 60 TO SCORE(4)
           MOVE 100 TO SCORE(5)
           COMPUTE TOTAL = FUNCTION SUM(SCORE(ALL))
           COMPUTE RANGE-VAL = FUNCTION RANGE(SCORE(ALL))
           MOVE FUNCTION MEAN(SCORE(ALL)) TO MEAN-VAL
           MOVE FUNCTION VARIANCE(SCORE(ALL)) TO VARIANCE-VAL
           DISPLAY "SUM: " TOTAL
           DISPLAY "RANGE: " RANGE-VAL
           DISPLAY "MEAN: " MEAN-VAL
           DISPLAY "VARIANCE: " VARIANCE-VAL
           STOP RUN.
